  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of Service SOPs and Referrals for GBV survivors in the Republic of Mauritius (UNFPA Project)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative by UNFPA consists of the development of an essential GBV services package that supports the government of Mauritius in addressing GBV in a multi-sectoral, holistic manner - it will engage health, social services, justice and police sectors to define minimum standards, procedures, guidelines for GBV case management as well as protocols for collaboration and referrals to support GBV survivors in the Republic of Mauritius.</narrative>
  </description>
